<% content_for :title, "Volunteer | Mobility Exchange" %><div class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Bring your time and talents</p><h1>A small act.<br>A meaningful difference.</h1><p>Help receive, prepare, and share mobility equipment. There is a place for your skills in the next handoff.</p></div><div class="container form-layout"><section class="form-section"><div class="form-section-title"><span>01</span><h2>Join our volunteer community</h2></div><% if current_user.volunteer %><p>Application status: <%= status_badge(current_user.volunteer.approval_status) %></p><p class="muted">Your team access becomes available after approval.</p><%= link_to "View upcoming shifts →", shifts_path, class: "button" %><% else %><%= form_with url: volunteer_application_path do |f| %><div class="field"><%= f.label :skills, "Tell us about your skills and interests" %><%= f.text_area :skills, maxlength: 2000, placeholder: "Equipment preparation, organization, welcoming people…" %></div><%= f.submit "Apply to volunteer" %><% end %><% end %></section><aside class="form-sidebar"><%= design_icon("people") %><h3>Care comes in many forms.</h3><p>Help with equipment inspection, cleaning, preparation, and keeping the inventory organized.</p><p>Once approved, choose from upcoming volunteer shifts that work for you.</p><%= link_to "Explore shifts →", shifts_path, class: "text-link" %></aside></div>
